ts (candidates 1 and 7):** a small buffer that grows slowly, with few shortages and little spoilage. Candidate 7 also cuts its last product 1 orders, which reduces end-of-game leftovers. These two look best.\n- **About 1.2× on both (candidate 5):** surplus builds up and starts to spoil, especially product 1 at roughly 6 units a day. Shortages are rare, though, so it is probably still in the top half.\n- **1.2× on product 0, exactly the forecast on product 1 (candidate 2):** product 1 drifts into shortage (each missing unit costs 9 in lost margin plus penalty), but the extra product 0 partly compensates.\n- **Exactly the forecast on both (candidate 4):** stock drifts down steadily and shortages pile up on both products. This is the worst of the 2-day plans.\n\n**My top four:** 1, 7, 5 and 2. Candidate 0 is the closest contender for fourth place."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4384, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4384}, "output_tokens": 10, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:16:23.146Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVQaRzD4465s4FYRV587"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01HfQQsAtDzPcvF7tVijHz8E", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVQaSGKqYFuvRyV54zfK", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01HfQQsAtDzPcvF7tVijHz8E